{"step_index":96,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T12:13:17Z","content":"Priyanshu, I see the screenshot. Your home feed is fully UPSC, IAS, Hindi drama — Stories Vibe, Shuaib Tales, Rajasthani Rasiya World. I get why you think it's a problem. But here's the truth:\n\n**Your watch history does NOT affect your creator channel. Period.**\n\nThese are two completely separate systems inside YouTube:\n\n| System | What it does | Based on |\n|--------|-------------|----------|\n| **Viewer algorithm** (YOUR home feed) | Decides what YouTube shows YOU | YOUR watch history |\n| **Creator algorithm** (YOUR channel's reach) | Decides who YouTube shows YOUR videos to | YOUR uploads, titles, descriptions, and who watches your content |\n\nThat \"fucked up\" home feed? It only affects what YOU see when you open YouTube. It has **zero effect** on whether YouTube recommends your audiobook videos to audiobook listeners. Your 